haltia-messenger (2.9.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * A file shared from another program stays in the chat where you attached it
    and never goes with a message in another chat. An accidental touch no
    longer picks a chat to send to.
  * The message menu now has «Ответить» (Reply): the reply shows a quote of
    the original message.
  * On the call screen, the microphone and camera buttons clearly show whether
    they are on. You can also see when the other person has turned off their
    microphone or camera. Your own picture is larger and sits at the bottom
    right. Video adapts to the tablet faster.
  * In «Найти или написать» (Find or write), your own chats narrow as you
    type. Profile photos now appear in the list and the chat.
  * The sign-in screen shows where to find «Войти по QR-коду» (Sign in by QR
    code) on the phone.
  * The program reconnects without a flood of repeated requests, and a lost
    connection no longer ends a call. Lists are faster, and many photos use
    less memory.

 -- Haltia <rensomail@gmail.com>  Thu, 22 Oct 2026 15:00:00 +0300

haltia-messenger (2.8.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * In a video call, the other person fills the screen and your own picture
    sits in a corner. Use «Включить камеру» (Turn camera on) and «Выключить
    камеру» (Turn camera off) to control the camera, or «Ответить без видео»
    (Answer without video) for an incoming call. The tablet uses its front
    camera.
  * The call screen now works like a phone: a green «Ответить» (Answer) beside
    a red «Отклонить» (Decline), «Выключить микрофон» (Mute microphone) and
    the talk’s time. Calls appear in the chat’s history, and a notification
    announces a missed call.
  * Your messages now show ✓ and ✓✓ for sent and read. A message that could
    not be sent stays marked «Не отправлено» (Not sent) with «Повторить»
    (Retry) and goes by itself when the connection returns. What you type
    meanwhile is never lost or sent twice.
  * A tap on a message opens its menu with «Копировать» (Copy) and «Переслать»
    (Forward). Open the chat’s menu with «⋮» or a tap on its name.
  * You can record a voice message with a tap on the microphone button, then
    send it with «Отправить» (Send).
  * A video plays with a tap on its preview, and a photo is enlarged with a
    double tap.
  * Other programs can send files to Messages: choose «Кому отправить?» (Who
    to send to?). Documents from messages open in the system’s program, PDF in
    Documents.
  * The settings used most often now come first.

 -- Haltia <rensomail@gmail.com>  Thu, 22 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0300

haltia-messenger (2.7.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * You can now make voice calls to MAX contacts. An incoming call rings and
    wakes the tablet’s screen; one big button answers it. Before calling a
    contact, the program asks «Позвонить …?» (Call …?).
  * During a call, the other person’s voice comes through the speaker and echo
    is suppressed on the tablet. The tablet stays awake until the call ends.
  * A second call during a conversation gets a busy answer. Quitting the
    program ends the call properly.
  * Calls are available only where the needed GStreamer components are
    installed.
  * The licence is now GPL-3.0-or-later.

 -- Haltia <rensomail@gmail.com>  Wed, 21 Oct 2026 23:30:00 +0300

